WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Xiyisisa laha moya wa ntamu lowu omeke wu humaka kona.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Byala hi ku tsemakanya moya etlhelweni leri wu humaka eka rona.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Endla ntila wo leha lowu nga riki na swivandla. Moya wu hatlisa loko wu hundza hi le xivindleni.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.000
Tshika moya wun'wana wu hundza emirinhi. Endzhaku ka rirhangu leri tiyeke moya wu rhendzeleka.

00:00:29.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Veka mirhi yo leha etlhelweni ra moya, ya le xikarhini endzhaku ka yona, ni swihlahla leswi komeke.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Siya mpfhuka phakathi ka mirhi na swibyariwa leswaku ku vonakala ku fika emibedhini.
